["pañcamastaraṅgaḥ", "iti śrīmanmahārājādhirājaśrīpratāpasiṃhasāhaviracite puraścaryārṇave sāmānyapuraścaraṇavidhirnāma ṣaṣṭhastaraṅgaḥ", "iti śrīmanmahārājādhirājapratāpasiṃhasāhaviracite puraścaryārṇave mantrasiddhilakṣaṇopāyapuraścaraṇabhedanirūpaṇaṃ nāma saptamastaraṅgaḥ", "iti śrīmanmahārājādhirājaśrīpratāpasiṃhasāhaviracite puraścaryārṇave gaṇeśādimantrapuraścaraṇavivecanaṃ nāmāṣṭamastaraṅgaḥ"]